---
// <ReviewNote> — editorial review notes appended at the end of a lesson:
// suspected translation errors, outdated facts or source mistakes, each with a
// suggested correction. The original text above stays untouched; this block is
// added content, so verify-fidelity and the search index both skip it.
// Dashed outline signals "editorial layer, not source text".
---

<aside class="review-note" aria-labelledby="review-note-title">
  <p class="review-note__title" id="review-note-title">Ghi chú hiệu đính</p>
  <p class="review-note__lead">
    Các điểm dưới đây có thể cần chỉnh trong nội dung gốc. Nội dung gốc phía trên được giữ nguyên.
  </p>
  <div class="review-note__body">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .review-note {
    margin: 36px 0 0;
    padding: 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-3);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .review-note__title {
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--text-callout);
    letter-spacing: var(--track-tight);
  }

  .review-note__lead {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .review-note__body :global(ul) {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .review-note__body :global(li + li) {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
